  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategies with detailed action plans for Electronic and Battery Waste Circularity in Tamil Nadu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address the issue of increasing electronic and battery waste in Tamil Nadu and will develop two separate state level strategies and action plans for e-waste and battery waste circularity in TN, in collaboration with the government of Tamil Nadu. The project will also draw on expertise and relevant best practices from across the world including the UK and facilitate potential partnerships between the UK and Tamil Nadu.</narrative>
  </description>
